  "gui.fletcherstrestle.guide.woodworking.shave.desc": "Place a log on the Shaving Horse, then strike it with the Drawknife to whittle it into a rough limb. Each click shaves a little more.",
  "gui.fletcherstrestle.guide.woodworking.steam.desc": "Put a rough limb in the Steam Box with water and fuel. Steaming makes the limb pliable, ready to be bent into a bow.",
  "gui.fletcherstrestle.guide.woodworking.fletch.desc": "At the Fletching Table, slot in two limbs, a riser and a string, then play the tuning minigame to assemble a finished bow. A better score means a better-tuned bow.",
  "gui.fletcherstrestle.guide.woodworking.bow_example": "Example bow:",
